{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"bd141699cf8da9ee41e45b48c98d8ce5540704510081f4441907f507c67b75ad","digest":{"component_or_area":"compaction engine and triggers","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/compact.py","src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py","src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py","src/rebar/_config_schema.py",".github/workflows/compact-sweep.yml","src/rebar/attest/authorship.py","src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py","_compact_locked","_scan_snapshot_state","_foldable_event_count","compact_all_cli","run_sweep","record_sweep","write_lock_is_busy","stamped_file_is_stale","REBAR_COMPACT_TRIGGER","compact.threshold"],"problem_keywords":["compaction","out-of-band","sweep","store lock","git history walk","event logs","scheduled trigger","operation-linked fallback","advisory lock","detached worker"],"propositions":["Event logs grow unbounded without a standing compaction trigger, since operation-linked compact-on-close was removed to fix a 13m53s lock-hold P0.","A scheduled sweep works amortized where CI exists, but leaves stores with no CI and no cron without any compaction mechanism.","The sweep must select tickets by foldable-event count over threshold OR lacking a snapshot with foldable events, not by raw live count, to avoid reselecting tickets whose excess is inside the fold horizon.","Compaction must spawn detached and probe once before the lock, or stand-aside if the store is busy, to avoid competing with foreground writers.","Git history walks per ticket under the store lock cause multi-hour lock holds; the walk must be hoisted out of the lock and batched across all tickets via a single pass."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8